data: {"id": "da86ee63bd1f46d0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1224", "run_id": "da86ee63bd1f46d0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我现在已经掌握了关键事实。让我总结已采集的证据：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 状态证据\n1. **Pod 当前状态**: Pending（非 Running），ContainerCreating（waiting），从未启动过（restarts=0）\n2. **节点调度**: 调度到 node2 (10.2.0.50)\n3. **控制器链**: Deployment workload → ReplicaSet workload-5dbb5dcd6c → Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v\n4. **容器配置**: 镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，无 imagePullSecrets\n5. **关键注解**: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`\n\n### 根因证据（来自 kubectl_describe）\n- **FailedCreatePodSandBox**: kubelet 报告沙箱创", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788428922146, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

